<title>CANADA: CP to buy back 600,000 PanCanadian shares.</title>
<headline>CP to buy back 600,000 PanCanadian shares.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Pacific Ltd said on Monday that it plans to buy about 600,000 additional shares of its subsidiary PanCanadian Petroleum Ltd.</p>
<p>The purchases will be made to offset the dilution resulting from the exercise of employee stock options, Canadian Pacific said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Montreal bureau 514-985-2434))</p>
</text>
